  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Festival du Desert</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Festival of the Desert is one of the most well-known and celebrated music festivals in Africa, and welcomes artists from the whole Sahel region. Since the armed conflict in northern Mali escalated in 2012, the Festival has been forced to organise its events in other parts of Mali as well as in refugee camps in the neighbouring countries, and has increased its focus on peace, dialogue and reconciliation.</narrative>
  </description>
